+# Postbox 3.2.0, free edition
+
+A small client for the Postbox mail service. This copy is the free edition.
+
+## Sending
+
+`PostboxClient#send(recipients, subject, body)` sends 1 message to every address of `recipients` from the sender address the client was created with, and returns 1 `DeliveryReceipt`.
+
+When the service does not accept the message, `send` throws `PostboxUnavailable` and sends nothing. The call does not retry.
+
+`DeliveryReceipt#sentAt()` returns the time the service accepted the message, in seconds since the epoch, in UTC.
